# The standard profile gives the AI verbs a VS Code user reaches for
# VS Code's own chords: Ask Claude… is Open Quick Chat's
# Ctrl+Alt+Shift+L, and the editor menu's row prints it. The chord
# runs the row's command: the Ask Claude prompt opens.
write doc.txt "ED01\nED02\nED03"
open doc.txt
command view.toggle_tree
rightclick 40 5
expect screen contains "Ask Claude…         Ctrl+Alt+Shift+L │"
key esc
expect screen lacks "Ask Claude…"
key ctrl+alt+shift+l
expect screen contains "Ask Claude"
key esc
command editor.use_vim
rightclick 40 5
expect screen contains "Ask Claude…                Space a a │"
expect screen lacks "Ctrl+Alt+Shift+L"
key esc
